    "%@ only lists nutrition per serving. With the weight, Vitalion stores values per 100 %@ so you can log any amount. Skip to log by servings only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ only lists nutrition per serving. With the weight, Vitalion stores values per 100 %2$@ so you can log any amount. Skip to log by servings only."
