    "A guess at what the photo shows, matched to foods on this iPhone. Amounts are not estimated: set them yourself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pretpostavka o tome što je na fotografiji, povezana s namirnicama na ovom iPhoneu. Količine se ne procjenjuju: postavi ih ručno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A link doesn't prove that one causes the other." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Povezanost ne dokazuje da jedno uzrokuje drugo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A meal always uses the current values of its foods. Tap an amount to change it, swipe to remove a food, hold and drag to reorder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obrok uvijek koristi trenutačne vrijednosti svojih namirnica. Dodirni količinu da je promijeniš, povuci prstom za uklanjanje namirnice, zadrži i povuci za promjenu redoslijeda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new target applies from today. Past days keep the target they had. Macros keep their current split." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Novi cilj vrijedi od danas. Prošli dani zadržavaju cilj koji su imali. Makronutrijenti zadržavaju trenutačnu raspodjelu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification at %lld:00 on the check-in day. Off by default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obavijest u %lld:00 na dan provjere. Zadano je isključena."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A straight line through your weigh-ins goes from %@ on %@ to %@ on %@: %@ in %lld days, which is %@ per week." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "A straight line through your weigh-ins goes from %1$@ on %2$@ to %3$@ on %4$@: %5$@ in %6$lld days, which is %7$@ per week."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ravna linija kroz tvoja vaganja ide od %1$@ (%2$@) do %3$@ (%4$@): %5$@ u razdoblju od %6$lld dana, što je %7$@ tjedno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A young trend still lags behind your weigh-ins, so until it is %lld days old with weigh-ins on at least %lld of the last %lld days, the change is measured with the line instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "A young trend still lags behind your weigh-ins, so until it is %1$lld days old with weigh-ins on at least %2$lld of the last %3$lld days, the change is measured with the line instead."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mlad trend još zaostaje za tvojim vaganjima, pa se promjena mjeri linijom sve dok trend ne dosegne starost od %1$lld dana i dok nema vaganja u barem %2$lld od zadnjih %3$lld dana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
